&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;🚀 We’re on a mission to make money work for everyone.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re waving goodbye to the complicated and confusing ways of traditional banking.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After starting as a prepaid card, our product offering has grown a lot in the last 10 years in the UK. As well as&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/personal&quot;&gt;personal&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/business-banking&quot;&gt;business&lt;/a&gt; bank accounts, we offer &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/joint-account&quot;&gt;joint accounts&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/16-17&quot;&gt;accounts for 16-17 year olds&lt;/a&gt;, a &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/under-16s&quot;&gt;free kids account&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/flex&quot;&gt;credit cards&lt;/a&gt; in the UK, with more exciting things to come beyond. Our UK customers can also &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/savings&quot;&gt;save&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/investments&quot;&gt;invest &lt;/a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/pensions&quot;&gt;combine their pensions&lt;/a&gt; with us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With our hot coral cards and get-paid-early feature, combined with financial education on social media and our award winning customer service, we have a long history of creating magical moments for our customers!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re not about selling products - we want to solve problems and change lives through Monzo ❤️&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;📍London or Remote (UK)&amp;nbsp; | 💰 &amp;nbsp;£85,000 - £105,000 + Incentive Awards tied to your performance +&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt; Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⭐Our Model Oversight team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The second line of defence Model Oversight team (that’s us!) provides support to our colleagues in Borrowing, Fincrime &amp;amp; Fraud, Finance and Operations to help Monzo grow safely. We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Model Validation Senior Manager - Gen AI&lt;/strong&gt; to lead the teams’ oversight of Generative AI models/use cases (primarily built across Monzo’s Operations squads) to provide assurance that the models/use cases we use are not only good for Monzo but what&#39;s best for our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🔑You’ll play a key role by...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Driving the embedding of the Model Risk Framework for Generative AI use cases across Monzo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the collaboration with the first line of defence teams to strengthen policies, standards and procedures for Generative AI model, use case, system design and build, implementation, governance, monitoring and use.&amp;nbsp; Helping to embed best practice of Generative AI across the business.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the setting and maintenance of Generative AI validation methods, evidence expectations and reusable technical assets with relevant 1LoD modelling teams, applicable across all model risk areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Convert modelling/validation experience into controlled playbooks, tests and working examples that can be applied to 2LoD Validation standards and processes for all Generative AI models, use cases, systems overseen by the 2LoD Model Oversight team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach Generative AI validation methodologies, to 2LoD Model Oversight colleagues, whom already have transferable Machine Learning skills, to reduce reliance on any single specialist for the validation of Generative AI models, use cases, systems so it can be consistently applied across Financial, Credit and Fincrime/Fraud models.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leading the 2LoD Oversight of Operational Model Risk&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform, and oversee, independent model validations of new Operational models (primarily Generative AI models, use cases, systems),&amp;nbsp; and changes to existing, using proportionate modelling techniques depending on the level of complexity applied. This includes writing clear and impactful model validation reports and presenting the findings in relevant committees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships with first line of defence modelling teams that develop Operational Models, and wider risk teams, to support the embedding of the model risk framework to help Monzo grow safely.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review ongoing model performance monitoring to ensure Operational models are performing within risk thresholds and providing support to the relevant model development team when further action is required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitoring and measuring the overall level of Operational model risk that Monzo operates, and driving action plans with first line teams and appropriate governance forums to mitigate residual model risk within desired risk appetite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Being a senior advocate of Model Risk Management best practices&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the effective operation of the Model Risk Oversight Committee as a regular attendee, contributing to the group discussion to improve model risk management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote and help embed a strong risk culture, making risk meaningful and relevant to everyone at Monzo. You will share best practice that is easy for everyone to understand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🤩We’d love to hear from you if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are highly motivated and energised by the idea of bringing positive impact to our customers and Monzo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are self-motivated and thrive in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have great attention to detail while keeping an eye on the big picture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a great communicator, able to articulate complex problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can provide effective challenge whilst building strong, respectful relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are keen to grow your knowledge in both business and technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;And, from a technical and knowledge perspective, you should have&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Robust Data Science or Machine Learning background with strong Python capability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with design of Generative AI evaluation frameworks, architectures, methods, practical tooling and platform alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Gemini implementations and change assessment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of managing a modelling project through its full lifecycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If possible, some understanding of some of the following:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coaching and standard setting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Banking MRM and regulatory context&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🙌What’s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰£85,000 - £105,000 ➕ Incentive Awards tied to your performance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📍This role can be based in our London or Cardiff offices, or be distributed working within the UK (with ad hoc meetings in London)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⏰We offer flexible working hours and trust you to work enough hours to do your job well, and at times that suit you and your team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚£1,000 learning budget each year to use on books, training courses and conferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;➕ Plus lots more!&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt; Read our full list of benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌈 The application journey has 4 key steps:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;- Phone call with recruiter - 30 mins&lt;br&gt;- Initial call with hiring manager - 30 mins&lt;br&gt;- Assessment &amp;amp; technical interview - 60 mins&lt;br&gt;- Leadership &amp;amp; Behavioural Interview - 60 mins&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This process should take around 4-8 weeks - your schedule is really important to us, so we promise to be as flexible as possible!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have some guidelines on using Artificial Intelligence (AI) to ace an application and interview at Monzo. &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/the-ultimate-guide-on-using-ai-to-ace-an-interview-at-monzo&quot;&gt;You can read them here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-TK1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunities for everyone&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diversity and inclusion are a priority for us and we’re making sure we have lots of support for all of our people to grow at Monzo. At Monzo, we’re embracing diversity by fostering an inclusive environment for all people to do the best work of their lives with us. This is integral to our mission of making money work for everyone. You can read more in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/diversity-and-inclusion&quot;&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt;, 2026 &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/our-2026-diversity-and-inclusion-report&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Diversity and Inclusion Report&lt;/a&gt; and 2025 &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/gender-pay-gap-report-2025&quot;&gt;Gender Pay Gap Report.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunity employer. All applicants will be considered for employment without attention to age, ethnicity, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, family or parental status, national origin, or veteran, neurodiversity or disability status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a preferred name, please use it to apply. We don&#39;t need full or birth names at application stage 😊&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Banyan Software is the best permanent home for software businesses that serve specialized industries, their employees, and their customers. With a buy-grow-and-hold-for-life approach and a permanent capital base, Banyan acquires and grows companies worldwide, honoring founder legacies and helping portfolio companies modernize through shared AI expertise and operational discipline. Founded in 2016, Banyan operates more than 120 portfolio companies across North and South America, Europe, and APAC, and has appeared on the Inc. 5000 list for six consecutive years. The Banyan Software Foundation, endowed with $100 million in Banyan stock, leverages technology to build a greener and more equitable world.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-impact opportunity to work directly alongside one of Banyan’s seasoned Operating Leaders, each overseeing a portfolio of software businesses in a buy, hold and grow investment model. As &lt;strong&gt;Chief of Staff&lt;/strong&gt;, you become a trusted right hand to your Operating Leader and a close working partner to the CEOs and functional leaders across their companies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role is deliberately broad. Rather than a fixed rotation, you will move across multiple operating companies and business problems: shaping a go-to-market plan for one company, improving customer onboarding at another, or standing up the first 100 days of a newly acquired business. You will gain exposure to software M&amp;amp;A, but the core of the job is hands-on value creation and operating work. You own initiatives end to end.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Executive Leadership Program&lt;/strong&gt; (ELP) runs two years. Development is intentional. You will work through a range of experiences spanning go-to-market, M&amp;amp;A, customer, and finance priorities portfolio-wide, plus gain hands-on leadership reps, with regular check-ins and development opportunities to ready you for your next role. High performers move from the ELP program into a CEO or C-suite role within a Banyan operating company, or into a leadership role at Banyan Software HQ.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For those who want to learn how great vertical software businesses are built and run, and who want the fastest path available to running one themselves, this is the job.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Gain&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A cohort of high-calibre peers&lt;/strong&gt;. You grow and learn alongside other ELPs at Banyan, building a long-term network of future operators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Direct apprenticeship with senior operators&lt;/strong&gt;. You will work very closely with an Operating Leader and see first-hand how experienced leaders make decisions across different software businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dedicated development support&lt;/strong&gt;. External executive coaching in Year 2, plus mentorship from Operating Leaders with decades of software experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The fastest track we offer to running a business&lt;/strong&gt;. High performers move directly from this program into a C-suite seat inside a Banyan operating company or a leadership role at HQ. It is not guaranteed, performance decides placement, but it is the first place Banyan looks when those seats open and we have a strong track record of placing CEOs through our ELP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real operating reps, not case reps&lt;/strong&gt;. You carry a genuine initiative inside a live business and leadership-level stretch assignments, decisions that show up in a P&amp;amp;L.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Own&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Portfolio Value Creation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with CEOs and functional leaders across multiple operating companies to identify priorities and implement the Banyan Operating System, turning strategy into measurable operational improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead high-impact, cross-functional projects across product, go-to-market, sales, marketing, pricing, and customer success as the right hand to Leader.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;M&amp;amp;A and Integration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gain exposure to Banyan’s acquisition process, including value-creation plan framing during diligence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support integration planning and onboarding for newly acquired businesses, helping establish operating rhythms and priorities while respecting what already makes each business work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help execute the value-creation plan once a deal closes, turning the diligence thesis into the specific operating bets a business needs to win in year one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Partnership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support your Operating Leader on critical initiatives, executive decision-making, and cross-company collaboration, frequently influencing outcomes without formal authority or direct reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the judgment, breadth, and pattern recognition required for future general management by working different business problems across a portfolio of vertical software companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must-Haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recently graduated from a top MBA program. This cycle is not open to first-year MBA students.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2–5 years of pre-MBA experience in an operating role (product, business operations, portfolio operations, or value creation), management consulting, private equity, or investment banking, with a demonstrated record of owning measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication and interpersonal judgment, with the ability to synthesize complex information and influence senior stakeholders without relying on formal authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High learning agility and comfort with ambiguity. You get smart quickly in unfamiliar areas, prioritize what matters, and move from analysis to action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Low ego and high ownership. You are ambitious but humble, seek feedback, build trust quickly, and are motivated by the work of operating a business rather than by title.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-Haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in software, SaaS, or another recurring revenue business. Familiarity with vertical software economics is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading a team. Direct people management is not required; this role initially relies on leadership through influence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
